    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>俱乐部说明</>\n加入或创建俱乐部，可以参与各种俱乐部活动玩法，获取丰厚的活动奖励和同行纹章，同行纹章可在俱乐部商店中兑换奖励道具。\n俱乐部分为休闲俱乐部和战斗俱乐部，可在俱乐部信息修改处进行调整，休闲俱乐部不会在成员列表显示非凡评分。\n俱乐部成员锁定规则：在以俱乐部为单位的玩法活动（如四方联赛、歌剧魅影、猎城战、高原战）期间，俱乐部不允许成员的加入和退出。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>创建响应俱乐部</>\n角色等级到达20级，可以选择加入俱乐部或自行创建俱乐部。\n创建俱乐部需要缴纳创建费用，创建后24小时内响应人数达到4人则创建成功，超时将创建失败。\n创建失败和主动取消创建，都不会返还创建费用。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Club Instructions</>\nJoin or create a Club to participate in various Club activities, obtain rich event rewards and Peer Emblems. Peer Emblems can be exchanged for reward items in the Club shop.\nClubs are divided into Leisure Clubs and Combat Clubs, which can be adjusted in the Club information modification section. Leisure Clubs will not display Beyonder ratings in the member list.\nClub member locking rules: During Club-based gameplay activities (such as Four-Way League, Phantom of the Opera, Hunting City War, Plateau War), Clubs do not allow members to join or leave.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Creating a Responsive Club</>\nWhen your character reaches level 20, you can choose to join a Club or create one yourself.\nCreating a Club requires paying a creation fee. If the number of responses reaches 4 within 24 hours after creation, the creation is successful; otherwise, it will fail.\nNeither failed creation nor active cancellation of creation will refund the creation fee.",
